            "Discover the epitome of coastal elegance at our 3-bedroom oasis, nestled near the sun-kissed shores of 30A and Rosemary Beach. No other home has a GAME ROOM like ours! This enchanting retreat seamlessly combines beachside tranquility with modern luxury. Have a community POOL with loungers and changing rooms! Immerse yourself in the airy, open-concept living space adorned with tasteful coastal decor. The gourmet kitchen, equipped with state-of-the-art appliances, beckons culinary delights. Unwind in the master suite boasting panoramic views, or retreat to the two equally inviting bedrooms. Beyond the pristine interiors, a game room promises lively entertainment for all. The pièce de résistance is the private outdoor haven — a lush patio, perfect for al fresco dining, and just moments away from the pristine beaches. With Rosemary Beach's charming boutiques and 30A's vibrant atmosphere nearby, this gem offers a centrally located haven for a beachside escape like no other.",
